  "question": {
    "text": "For a complex number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math>, if <math><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></math> and <math><mi>z</mi></math> does not lie in the first quadrant, then (where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">arg</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">arg</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Put <math><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />Case <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> if <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi></math>, then <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />Case <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> if <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>&#981;</mi></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p>"
  }
